; Summarizable and Fillable from Vision/ethos.md; SinkError is the enclosing module's.
; push takes any Summarizable: a capability's input is a kind, never a concrete type.
Library
[ super:SinkError ]
[]
[ Summarizable.[ summarize.[ String ] ]
  Fillable.[ push!{ [ Summarizable ] [ Result<Integer SinkError> ] }
             drain![ Vector<String> ]
             create:[ Self ] ] ]
[]
